*has* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''has(container, needle)''

Checks if ''container'' contains ''needle''.

*Parameters:*
- ''container'': Map, list, string, or bytes to search
- ''needle'': Key (map), element (list), substring (string), or byte value (bytes)

*Returns:*
- ''true'': Container contains needle
- ''false'': Container does not contain needle
- ''err'' if ''needle'' is an empty string

*Errors:*
- Runtime error if ''container'' is not a map, list, string, or bytes
- Runtime error if ''needle'' type does not match the type of the ''container''
- Runtime error if ''container'' is bytes and ''needle'' is not between 0 and 255
